<body dir="ltr" style="max-width:8.5in;margin-top:0.7874in; margin-bottom:0.7874in; margin-left:0.7874in; margin-right:0.7874in; ">
<h1 class="paragraph-P1"><a id="a__Privacy_Policy"><span/></a>Privacy Policy</h1>

<p class="paragraph-P2"><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T1">Last Updated: </span></span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T2">11</span></span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T3">/0</span></span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T2">5</span></span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T3">/2026</span></span></p>

<p class="paragraph-P2"><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T4">Pixlock</span></span><span class="text-T5"> (the "Game") is a simple puzzle game developed by </span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T6">Xoja Games</span></span><span class="text-T5">. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle your information when you use our Game.</span></p>
<h2 class="paragraph-P3"><a id="a__1__Information_We_Collect"><span/></a>1. Information We Collect</h2>

<p class="paragraph-P4"><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T7">Age (for legal compliance only)</span></span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T1"><br/></span></span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T5">When you first launch the game, we ask for your age. This is used only on your device to determine whether to enable child-directed or under-age-of-consent ad settings. No age data is stored or sent to our servers.</span></span></p>

<p class="paragraph-P4"><span class="text-T5">You do not need to create an account, provide an email address, or submit any </span><span class="text-T8">other </span><span class="text-T5">personal data to play our Game.</span></p>

<p class="paragraph-P2"><span class="text-T8">In addition</span><span class="text-T5">, our Game uses </span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T1">Google AdMob</span></span><span class="text-T5"> to display advertisements. AdMob is a third-party service provided by Google LLC that may collect certain data automatically to serve and improve ads.</span></p>
<h3 class="paragraph-P5"><a id="a__What_AdMob_Collects"><span/></a>What AdMob Collects</h3>

<p class="paragraph-P6">According to Google's documentation, the Google Mobile Ads SDK may collect the following types of information :</p>


<table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="table-Table1"><colgroup><col width="212"/><col width="477"/></colgroup><tr class="row-Table1_1"><td style="text-align:left;width:1.9076in; " class="cell-Table1_A1">
<p class="paragraph-P7">Data Type</p>
</td><td style="text-align:left;width:4.2944in; " class="cell-Table1_A1">
<p class="paragraph-P7">Examples</p>
</td></tr><tr class="row-Table1_1"><td style="text-align:left;width:1.9076in; " class="cell-Table1_A2">
<p class="paragraph-P8"><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T9">IP Address</span></span></p>
</td><td style="text-align:left;width:4.2944in; " class="cell-Table1_A2">
<p class="paragraph-P9">Used to estimate your approximate location</p>
</td></tr><tr class="row-Table1_1"><td style="text-align:left;width:1.9076in; " class="cell-Table1_A2">
<p class="paragraph-P8"><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T9">Device ID</span></span></p>
</td><td style="text-align:left;width:4.2944in; " class="cell-Table1_A2">
<p class="paragraph-P9">Advertising identifier (AAID on Android, IDFA on iOS)</p>
</td></tr><tr class="row-Table1_1"><td style="text-align:left;width:1.9076in; " class="cell-Table1_A2">
<p class="paragraph-P8"><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T9">Device Information</span></span></p>
</td><td style="text-align:left;width:4.2944in; " class="cell-Table1_A2">
<p class="paragraph-P9">Device model, operating system version, screen size</p>
</td></tr><tr class="row-Table1_1"><td style="text-align:left;width:1.9076in; " class="cell-Table1_A2">
<p class="paragraph-P8"><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T9">App Interactions</span></span></p>
</td><td style="text-align:left;width:4.2944in; " class="cell-Table1_A2">
<p class="paragraph-P9">Ad impressions, clicks, video views</p>
</td></tr><tr class="row-Table1_1"><td style="text-align:left;width:1.9076in; " class="cell-Table1_A2">
<p class="paragraph-P8"><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T9">Performance Data</span></span></p>
</td><td style="text-align:left;width:4.2944in; " class="cell-Table1_A2">
<p class="paragraph-P9">App launch time, crash logs, hang rates</p>
</td></tr><tr class="row-Table1_1"><td style="text-align:left;width:1.9076in; " class="cell-Table1_A7">
<p class="paragraph-P8"><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T9">Diagnostic Information</span></span></p>
</td><td style="text-align:left;width:4.2944in; " class="cell-Table1_A7">
<p class="paragraph-P10">Non-user related crash logs to improve SDK performance</p>
</td></tr></table>


<p class="paragraph-P6">AdMob uses this data to:</p>
<ul><li><p class="P11" style="margin-left:0cm;"><span class="Bullet_20_Symbols" style="display:block;float:left;min-width:0cm;">•</span>Show you relevant ads<span class="odfLiEnd"/> </p></li><li><p class="P11" style="margin-left:0cm;"><span class="Bullet_20_Symbols" style="display:block;float:left;min-width:0cm;">•</span>Measure ad performance<span class="odfLiEnd"/> </p></li><li><p class="P11" style="margin-left:0cm;"><span class="Bullet_20_Symbols" style="display:block;float:left;min-width:0cm;">•</span>Improve the SDK's stability and functionality<span class="odfLiEnd"/> </p></li></ul><h2 class="paragraph-P3"><a id="a__2__How_Your_Data_Is_Used"><span/></a>2. How Your Data Is Used</h2>

<p class="paragraph-P6">When you first launch the game, we may ask you to provide your age. This information is used locally on your device solely to determine whether to enable <span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T10">TagForChildDirectedTreatment</span></span> or <span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T10">TagForUnderAgeOfConsent</span></span> in compliance with applicable laws (such as the Children’s Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA) and the GDPR in the EU). <span class="text-T11">A</span>ll <span class="text-T11">the other</span> data processing is performed by Google AdMob for advertising purposes. Google may use the collected information to serve personalized or non-personalized ads based on your advertising preferences.</p>

<p class="paragraph-P2"><span class="text-T5">You can learn more about how Google uses data when you use apps that contain AdMob in Google's </span><a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" class="text-Internet_20_link"><span class="text-T12">How Google uses data when you use our partners' sites or apps</span></a><span class="text-T5">.</span></p>
