<p class="paragraph-P6">We do not share any data with any other third parties. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
<h2 class="paragraph-P3"><a id="a__4__Your_Choices_and_Controls"><span/></a>4. Your Choices and Controls</h2>
<h3 class="paragraph-P5"><a id="a__Ad_Preferences"><span/></a>Ad Preferences</h3>

<p class="paragraph-P6">You can control how ads are personalized using your device settings:</p>
<ul><li><p class="P12" style="margin-left:0cm;"><span class="Bullet_20_Symbols" style="display:block;float:left;min-width:0cm;">•</span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T1">On Android</span></span><span class="text-T5">: Go to Settings → Google → Ads → Opt out of Ads Personalization</span><span class="odfLiEnd"/> </p></li><li><p class="P12" style="margin-left:0cm;"><span class="Bullet_20_Symbols" style="display:block;float:left;min-width:0cm;">•</span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T1">On iOS</span></span><span class="text-T5">: Go to Settings → Privacy → Apple Advertising → Limit Ad Tracking</span><span class="odfLiEnd"/> </p></li></ul>
<p class="paragraph-P2"><span class="text-T5">You can also visit </span><a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" class="text-Internet_20_link"><span class="text-T12">Google Ad Settings</span></a><span class="text-T5"> to manage your preferences.</span></p>

<p class="paragraph-P13">Data Deletion Requests</p>

<p class="paragraph-P14"><span class="text-T14">If you wish to request deletion of data collected by AdMob, please contact us at </span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T15">xojagames@gmail.com</span></span><span class="text-T14">. We will forward your request to Google in accordance with their processes. You may also revoke consent through the consent management options provided within the Game (if applicable in your region).</span></p>
<h3 class="paragraph-P5"><a id="a__Deleting_Local_Game_Data"><span/></a>Deleting Local Game Data</h3>

<p class="paragraph-P2"><span class="text-T5">All game progress, level completion data, settings, </span><span class="text-T16">and the age information you provided</span><span class="text-T5"> are stored </span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T1">only on your device</span></span><span class="text-T5"> using local storage. You can delete this data at any time by:</span></p>
<ul><li><p class="P15" style="margin-left:0cm;"><span class="Bullet_20_Symbols" style="display:block;float:left;min-width:0cm;">•</span>Uninstalling the Game, or<span class="odfLiEnd"/> </p></li><li><p class="P15" style="margin-left:0cm;"><span class="Bullet_20_Symbols" style="display:block;float:left;min-width:0cm;">•</span>Clearing the app's data through your device settings<span class="odfLiEnd"/> </p></li></ul><h2 class="paragraph-P3"><a id="a__5__Children's_Privacy__COPPA_Compliance_"><span/></a>5. Children's Privacy (COPPA Compliance)</h2>

<p class="paragraph-P6"><span class="text-T17">Our game is a simple puzzle game suitable for all ages. To comply with children’s privacy laws (such as COPPA in the U.S. and GDPR in the EU), we ask for your age </span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T18">on the very first launch</span></span><span class="text-T17">. This age check happens locally on your device and is used only to automatically set:</span></p>
<ul><li><p class="P16" style="margin-left:0cm;"><span class="Bullet_20_Symbols" style="display:block;float:left;min-width:0cm;">•</span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T19">TagForChildDirectedTreatment</span></span><span class="text-T20"> (for under 13 in the U.S.)</span><span class="odfLiEnd"/> </p></li><li><p class="P16" style="margin-left:0cm;"><span class="Bullet_20_Symbols" style="display:block;float:left;min-width:0cm;">•</span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T19">TagForUnderAgeOfConsent</span></span><span class="text-T20"> (for under applicable age in the EU/UK)</span><span class="odfLiEnd"/> </p></li></ul>
<p class="paragraph-P17"><span class="text-T20">We do </span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T19">not</span></span><span class="text-T20"> store, transmit, or retain your age information on our servers. Based on your provided age, Google AdMob will serve </span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T19">non-personalized ads</span></span><span class="text-T20"> to children or users under age of consent, in full compliance with COPPA and GDPR.</span></p>

<p class="paragraph-P18"><span class="text-T21">If you do not provide your age, the game defaults to the strictest child-directed settings. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has bypassed this age screen, please contact us at </span><span class="text-Strong_20_Emphasis"><span class="text-T22">xojagames@gmail.com</span></span><span class="text-T21">.</span></p>
<h2 class="paragraph-P3"><a id="a__6__Data_Security"><span/></a>6. Data Security</h2>

<p class="paragraph-P6">No age information is stored on our servers or linked to any persistent identifier. The age selection is only used to configure third-party ad networks and analytics tools to comply with legal requirements for child-directed or age-appropriate treatment. All game data remains on your device. Data collected by AdMob is handled according to Google's security practices.</p>
<h2 class="paragraph-P3"><a id="a__7__International_Data_Transfers"><span/></a>7. International Data Transfers</h2>

<p class="paragraph-P6">AdMob is operated by Google LLC, which processes data globally. Your information may be transferred to and stored on servers located outside of your country of residence, including the United States. Google complies with international data transfer frameworks, including the EU-US Data Privacy Framework where applicable.</p>
<h2 class="paragraph-P3"><a id="a__8__Changes_to_This_Privacy_Policy"><span/></a>8. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

<p class="paragraph-P6">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. If we make material changes, we will notify you by updating the "Last Updated" date at the top of this policy and, where appropriate, by displaying a notice within the Game.</p>
<h2 class="paragraph-P3"><a id="a__9__Contact_Us"><span/></a>9. Contact Us</h2>

<p class="paragraph-P6">If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or your data, please contact us at:</p>

